[00:00.00] 作词 : David Wen Wei Liang
[00:00.00][by:Je-L]
[00:00.40] 作曲 : David Wen Wei Liang
[00:19.32]There are songs we sing in silence
[00:19.32]有些歌曲我们默默地唱
[00:24.42]There are words we choose to hide
[00:24.42]有些话我们选择埋藏
[00:29.13]In our faces no emotion
[00:29.13]我们的脸上没有表情
[00:34.39]With our fists clenched by our side
[00:34.39]我们的拳头紧紧握起
[00:38.74]We let it burn
[00:38.74]让它燃烧吧
[00:43.54]Under our skin
[00:43.54]在皮肤下燃烧
[00:49.35]And we stand calm and collected
[00:49.35]我们镇定地站着
[00:54.10]We’re so cool and in control
[00:54.10]那样冷静 掌控一切
[00:59.22]Don’t take comfort in this quiet
[00:59.22]别对这寂静掉以轻心
[01:04.61]Because something might explode
[01:04.61]因为有些东西正蓄势待发
[01:08.72]Just take the chance
[01:08.72]把握机会吧
[01:13.52]Don’t miss your turn
[01:13.52]别错过时机
[01:19.78]Play your song so loud, your song so loud, your song so loud
[01:19.78]大声地演奏你的歌曲 大点声 再大点声
[01:29.60]Hear your voice out loud, your voice out loud, just sing out loud
[01:29.60]听你用力地唱 用力地唱 用力地唱出来
[01:49.15]In our eyes we seek an answer
[01:49.15]我们从你的眼中寻求答案
[01:53.79]That our minds already know
[01:53.79]其实我们已经知晓
[01:58.90]That the truth lies not in secret
[01:58.90]真像并非隐藏于秘密之中
[02:04.05]But the stories that are told
[02:04.05]它们存在于那些已被讲述过的故事里
[02:09.34]Lift off the seal
[02:09.34]使你挣脱束缚
[02:13.34]That covers your lips
[02:13.34]畅所欲言
[02:19.90]Play your song so loud, your song so loud, your song so loud
[02:19.90]大声地演奏你的歌曲 大点声 再大点声
[02:29.87]Hear your voice out loud, your voice out loud, just sing out loud
[02:29.87]听你用力地唱 用力地唱 用力地唱出来
[02:40.53]Let it reach across the sky
[02:40.53]让它划破天际
[02:44.07]Hear it ring, watch it soar
[02:44.07]听它回响 看它翱翔
[02:50.52]Up above where nothing dies
[02:50.52]在那里没有死亡
[02:53.91]It’s your choice
[02:53.91]这是你的选择
[02:58.51]You have a choice
[02:58.51]做出你的抉择
[03:04.85]Play your song so loud, your song so loud, your song so loud
[03:04.85]大声地演奏你的歌曲 大点声 再大点声
[03:14.95]Hear your voice out loud, your voice out loud, just sing out loud
[03:14.95]听你用力地唱 用力地唱 用力地唱出来
[03:24.99]Play your song so loud, your song so loud, your song so loud
[03:24.99]大声地演奏你的歌曲 大点声 再大点声
[03:34.96]Hear your voice out loud, your voice out loud, just sing out loud
[03:34.96]听你用力地唱 用力地唱 用力地唱出来
